{
  "dn17:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 17 ",
  "dn17:0.2": "Mahāsudassanasutta ",
  "dn17:1.1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn17:1.1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kusinārāyaṁ viharati upavattane mallānaṁ sālavane antarena yamakasālānaṁ parinibbānasamaye. ",
  "dn17:1.2.1": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā ānando bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "dn17:1.2.2": "“mā, bhante, bhagavā imasmiṁ khuddakanagarake ujjaṅgalanagarake sākhānagarake parinibbāyi. ",
  "dn17:1.2.3": "Santi, bhante, aññāni mahānagarāni. ",
  "dn17:1.2.4": "Seyyathidaṁ—campā, rājagahaṁ, sāvatthi, sāketaṁ, kosambī, bārāṇasī; ",
  "dn17:1.2.5": "ettha bhagavā parinibbāyatu. ",
  "dn17:1.2.6": "Ettha bahū khattiyamahāsālā brāhmaṇamahāsālā gahapatimahāsālā tathāgate abhippasannā, te tathāgatassa sarīrapūjaṁ karissantī”ti. ",
  "dn17:1.3.1": "“Mā hevaṁ, ānanda, avaca; mā hevaṁ, ānanda, avaca: ",
  "dn17:1.3.2": "‘khuddakanagarakaṁ ujjaṅgalanagarakaṁ sākhānagarakan’ti. ",
  "dn17:1.3.3.0": "1. Kusāvatīrājadhānī ",
  "dn17:1.3.4": "Bhūtapubbaṁ, ānanda, rājā mahāsudassano nāma ahosi khattiyo muddhāvasitto cāturanto vijitāvī janapadatthāvariyappatto. ",
  "dn17:1.3.5": "Rañño, ānanda, mahāsudassanassa ayaṁ kusinārā kusāvatī nāma rājadhānī ahosi. ",
  "dn17:1.3.6": "Puratthimena ca pacchimena ca dvādasayojanāni ā